        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">7. How It Compares</h2>
        <p>
          The T7xe doesn't exist in a vacuum — here's how it stacks up
          against the closest commercial-pedigree rival and a folding
          NordicTrack alternative at a lower price.
