        <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">Common Mistakes Buyers Make</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">The T7xe is commercial equipment sold to home buyers, and most mistakes come from that mismatch of expectations.</p>
        <div class="space-y-6 my-8">
          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Ignoring the fixed 36 x 81-inch footprint</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">This machine does not fold. Measure the space it will occupy permanently, including clearance behind it, before ordering. There is no reclaiming the floor later.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Reading the 4.0 CHP AC motor as overkill</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">It is sized for continuous use, which is why it stays cool and quiet under load. That is the feature you are buying; buyers who trade it away for a screen usually regret it.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Expecting consumer-style app integration</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">Matrix consoles are built around workout reliability rather than streamed classes. Check exactly which apps the console you are ordering supports rather than assuming parity with iFit machines.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Underestimating delivery and installation</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">Commercial frames are heavy and often need in-room assembly by the delivery team. Confirm what the shipping option actually includes before you book it.</p>
